<title>UK: Rabobank sets C$100 mln six-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets C$100 mln six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CIBC Wood Gundy and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NETHERLANDS</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    06.AUG.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.975   PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.375    SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/UK/NL/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.50 PCT SEPT 2002 CANADA.</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
